[h2]Build 0.9.17[/h2]
[h3]Fixed[/h3]
[list]
[*]Fixed the red "placingDraggableDimensions doesn't correspond to any field" errors on load. RimWorld 1.6 dropped that setting.
[*]Drag-placing works again. Tables, desks, rugs and planter boxes drag out as a filled area; couch seats, shelves, kitchen units, bookcases, wardrobes, benches and room dividers drag out as a line. Each has its own draw-style picker.
[*]Removed a duplicate furniture category entry on every Slopkea piece.
[/list]
